        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Remote Position</strong> is a story-driven horror mystery about obedience, secrets, and the unseen forces pulling the strings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A remote supervisor issues you strange, unnerving tasks. Each one drags you deeper into a puzzle of hidden motives and fractured truths. Explore a richly interactive environment, solve logic-based challenges woven into the world itself, and uncover the secret legacy your father left behind.<br><br>Every order brings you closer to a revelation you may not want to face.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3007310/extras/bd79acead47a92371aa61b0cd4e29c06.poster.avif?t=1761201305\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3007310/extras/bd79acead47a92371aa61b0cd4e29c06.webm?t=1761201305\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3007310/extras/bd79acead47a92371aa61b0cd4e29c06.mp4?t=1761201305\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engaging narrative with logic-based puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve environmental puzzles and survive the unknown</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-crafted world filled with dark secrets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tense atmosphere that keeps you on edge</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover hidden lore that shapes the story</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Remote Position</strong> is a story-driven horror mystery about obedience, secrets, and the unseen forces pulling the strings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A remote supervisor issues you strange, unnerving tasks. Each one drags you deeper into a puzzle of hidden motives and fractured truths. Explore a richly interactive environment, solve logic-based challenges woven into the world itself, and uncover the secret legacy your father left behind.<br><br>Every order brings you closer to a revelation you may not want to face.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3007310/extras/bd79acead47a92371aa61b0cd4e29c06.poster.avif?t=1761201305\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3007310/extras/bd79acead47a92371aa61b0cd4e29c06.webm?t=1761201305\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3007310/extras/bd79acead47a92371aa61b0cd4e29c06.mp4?t=1761201305\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engaging narrative with logic-based puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve environmental puzzles and survive the unknown</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-crafted world filled with dark secrets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tense atmosphere that keeps you on edge</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover hidden lore that shapes the story</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>",
